      "readme": "Resting-state EEG in Parkinson's disease and controls\n\nThis dataset contains resting-state EEG recordings organized according to BIDS.\n\nParticipant groups in participants.tsv:\n- PD\n- Control\n- DBS\n\nEEG data are stored in BrainVision Core Data Format (.vhdr, .vmrk, .eeg).\n\nTask label:\n- task-rest\n\nBefore public release:\n- Review dataset metadata and authorship.\n- Review the potential-PHI header scan report created outside this BIDS folder.\n- Run the official BIDS Validator and resolve all errors.\n- Confirm that ethics/consent permissions allow public sharing on OpenNeuro.\n",
